msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [avatar.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/avatar/avatar.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [avatar.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/avatar/avatar.css)"

#: css/avatar.md
